  <History Date="26-08-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (note dynamic mode changing via DMX is not currently supported.  implemented as separate modes.  There appear to be a number of different products but only one chart.)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="26-08-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="(confusing charts - littered with errors and inconsistencies - made best guess.  note gels are not currently documented )" Version="0" />
  <History Date="03-09-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="19" />
  <History Date="07-09-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Ext.Kelvin Single Pixel mode Atlabase IDs." Version="20" />
